## Competitive Context

TimescaleDB is commonly compared to InfluxDB, ClickHouse, MongoDB (for time-series), AWS Timestream, QuestDB, and vanilla PostgreSQL for time-series and analytics workloads. pg_textsearch is an alternative to Elasticsearch, OpenSearch, and ParadeDB for full-text search within PostgreSQL. Tiger Cloud competes with Amazon RDS, Amazon Aurora, Neon, Supabase, and Crunchy Data for managed PostgreSQL.

